flowchart TD
    A["代理执行（Agent runs）"] --> B{"值得记录的时刻？（Moment that matters?）"}
    B -- "状态转换·决策·外部调用" --> C["发出结构化事件（Emit structured event）"]
    B -- "无关琐事：不记录" --> A
    C --> D["类型化记录（Typed record）：输入·输出·动机"]
    D --> E["事件流（Event stream）"]
    E --> F["消费者（Consumers）：仪表盘·分析·下游代理"]
    F --> G["事后重建执行叙事（Reconstruct the run）"]
    G -. "发现无事件覆盖的盲区" .-> C
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class C,D core;
    class B gate;
    class A,E,F,G out;
